//- Account created
//- Rendered with the serialized User plus, for an invite, `Token`, `ResetUrl`, `ExpiresInMinutes`
//- and `IsInvite` (see `create()` in actions.ts). `ResetUrl` is empty unless `rbac.password.resetUrl` is configured.
doctype html
html
  head
    meta(charset='utf-8')
    title Account created
  body
    p Hello #{ Login || Email },
    p An account has been created for you.
    p
      | Sign in with: 
      strong #{ Email }
    p —
    p This is an automated message; please do not reply.
